description: Rebuild the programme-report PDF whenever its TeX changes
globs: erdos-straus-programme-report-*.{tex,pdf}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Programme report PDF

If you edit `erdos-straus-programme-report-*.tex`, rebuild the matching PDF
in the same turn with `./build-programme-report.sh` and commit both files
together. Never push TeX without the rebuilt PDF.
